  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Familiar Android — light and indigo",
    "overview": "Familiar Android — light and indigo is the approved visual direction. Clear native sans, large clock numerals, quiet surfaces, and rounded controls make the interface easy to scan while sleepy. Apple Clock informs time-first clarity and uncluttered editing; Android remains the authority for navigation, Back, insets, permissions, and control behavior.\n\nThe sun mark and Wake TF Up name retain the product’s personality. QR preparation leads the experience while standard dismissal remains an explicit per-alarm choice. Light is the default, with an intentionally paired dark appearance.",
